From c45b50438cce41d8a6893f2167002e32825cbc4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 21:16:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] perf: use Yuanrong multi-buffer APIs with configurable
 timeouts

Switch the Yuanrong backend to the synchronous multi-buffer APIs introduced by openyuanrong-datasystem.

Load Yuanrong client settings from the YR_CONFIG_PATH JSON file.

Remove the obsolete environment-variable configuration, compatibility helpers, and redundant device/empty-key handling.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
