-#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md:373
 msgid ""
-"Currently, the key-value pool in PD Disaggregate only stores the kv cache"
-" generated by the Prefill node by default. In models using MLA, it is now"
-" supported that the Decode node stores the kv cache for use by the "
-"Prefill node, enabled by adding `consumer_is_to_put: true` to the "
-"AscendStoreConnector. If the Prefill node enables PP, `prefill_pp_size` "
-"or `prefill_pp_layer_partition` also needs to be set. Example as follows:"
+"* The Yuanrong backend passes KV keys to the Datasystem SDK as-is, without\n"
+"  rewriting them. Ensure keys are valid Datasystem keys in production.\n"
+"* When `enable_remote_h2d` is `true` and `remote_h2d_transport_backend` is\n"
+"  `HIXL` (with `enable_fabric_mem` `false`), the backend pre-registers device\n"
+"  buffer pointers (`register_buffer`) with the Datasystem worker to enable\n"
+"  Remote H2D transfer. Under `P2P_TRANSFER` or FabricMem mode the backend\n"
+"  skips pre-registration and uses device pointers directly when building blob\n"
+"  lists."
 msgstr ""
-"目前，PD 解耦场景中的键值池默认仅存储由 Prefill 节点生成的 KV 缓存。在使用 MLA 的模型中，现已支持 Decode 节点存储 "
-"KV 缓存供 Prefill 节点使用，可通过在 `AscendStoreConnector` 中添加 `consumer_is_to_put: "
-"true` 来启用。如果 Prefill 节点启用了流水线并行（PP），则还需要设置 `prefill_pp_size` 或 "
-"`prefill_pp_layer_partition`。示例如下："
+"* 元戎后端将 KV 键原样传递给 Datasystem SDK，不做重写。请确保生产环境中的键是有效的"
+"  Datasystem 键。\n"
+"* 当 `enable_remote_h2d` 为 `true` 且 `remote_h2d_transport_backend` 为"
+"  `HIXL`（且 `enable_fabric_mem` 为 `false`）时，后端会向 Datasystem 工作进程"
+"  预注册设备缓冲区指针（`register_buffer`）以启用远程 H2D 传输。在"
+"  `P2P_TRANSFER` 或 FabricMem 模式下，后端跳过预注册，在构建 blob 列表时"
+"  直接使用设备指针。"
 
